#: src/snes9x.ui:9344
msgid ""
"  SuperSnes9x – A Portable Super Nintendo Entertainment System™ Emulator\n"
"\n"
"  Snes9x homepage: http://www.snes9x.com/\n"
"  SuperSnes9x source code: https://github.com/shanytc/snes9x/\n"
"\n"
"  Permission to use, copy, modify and/or distribute SuperSnes9x in both binary\n"
